sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Streamlit
    participant G as LangGraph
    participant L as LLM
    participant R as Retriever / Qdrant
    participant T as Tools / DuckDB
    User->>UI: "Did performance complaints drop after patch 2.0 of Cyberpunk 2077?"
    UI->>G: run (background thread, live steps)
    G->>L: router prompt
    L-->>G: in scope, needs retrieval, tools [review_sentiment, review_trend]
    G->>R: hybrid search, filtered to appid 1091500
    R-->>G: 6 chunks (patch notes, reviews)
    G->>L: agent prompt + matching patch titles with dates
    L-->>G: tool calls with split_date / event_date
    G->>T: review_sentiment, review_trend
    T-->>G: aspect shares before/after, p-values, trend
    G->>L: answer prompt (evidence: tools + sources)
    L-->>G: answer citing [T1] [T2] [1] [3]
    G-->>UI: answer, tool cards, sources, trace
    UI-->>User: rendered answer + charts
